<title>USA: Lam Research wins $22 mln order.</title>
<headline>Lam Research wins $22 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lam Research Corp, a maker of semiconductor manufacturing equipment, Monday said it won a $22 million order from Taiwan's Nan Ya Technology Corp.</p>
<p>The order includes several TCP 9100 oxide etchers and TCP 9400 polysilicon etchers configured on the multi-chamber Alliance platform. Lam said the multi-system order signals an important milestone in the market acceptance of Lam's TCP 9100.</p>
</text>
